Z||000000||Raydar||02-02-2000||09:55 AM||||I'm sure that many of you have seen this. If not, it's worth trying. <BR>This works with MS Word 97. Open a blank Word document. Type the words "unable to follow directions" (without the quotes), and highlight them. On the menu bar, click "Tools".<BR>Scroll down to "Language", and across to "Thesarus". It will give you a suggested replacement. <BR>Note: I'm not sure what the results will be for a non-US version of Word.||||reg||1
